Packtrix

> A modular, terminal-based Python cybersecurity toolkit.
> Network discovery · Packet capture · Threat detection · Live dashboard

**Version 0.1.4** · Zero runtime dependencies · Works out of the box

```bash
pip install packtrix
packtrix --help
```

