## Publishing

See [PUBLISHING.md](PUBLISHING.md) for the full step-by-step guide.

Quick reference:

```bash
# Install build tools
pip install build twine

# Build
python3 -m build

# Check
twine check dist/*

# Upload to PyPI
twine upload dist/*

# Anyone can then install with:
pip install packtrix
pip install "packtrix[live]"
```

